      "hash": "29a768799acab15b5a0ee28f241b6e057d0b5ff706c70c3edf7f24676f3d77a8"
    },
    {
      "id": "ff7c9de06a73dbb68dde94e918596539ad122d76b4c604d6a196a857beb30ae2",
      "text": "AI Coding Dictionary",
      "hash": "4def77f9388809f53620144510fcc4b6f08662617bcc06a15abc618242e6544c"
    },
    {
      "id": "c942df9b1e9712aeb1221ebbeb94273e604fcf506a86ed5e2cfd9f6ac647dc51",
      "text": "Topics",
      "hash": "e22820fcf5cd90e3fdd99a7569e0ee2f30eb7ebadfb2fe4d159b30c166ff81b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "d5350e2615f144aad06c9910c78a2a3b526e5837988301ccd9b3ac83351c7789",
      "text": "Memory and Steering",
      "hash": "e9396c915a0fb1c9f188708920573d4a5b1ec0a09639049682989999ecbdf3de"
    },
    {
      "id": "36494268ee48b9eea35ac35947f0a7fa3cf2503144fac6dff71510a1fe589d37",
      "text": "A file in the environment that the harness loads into the context window at session start — the project's standing brief to the agent.",
      "hash": "a1fcdbc29a02f700f77a1ad3793e6f196e207186642419719c9d492d48ad89c5"
    },
    {
      "id": "c71a47d2806a52bd4e87bc1d9351612347d918d2464541824adb05559d897d1f",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "41b9c7dcb0a5d709acc84e2906bb2f89afe2cfcfe68dfd4fd2936665ea412355",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "e8b92f01391443871394396f5dada2b8214853a8da859a3e479941259bce95db",
      "text": "A file in the",
      "hash": "16add85f68c4eab785147460efe28443031769716ea2799440311ab67e1bfa6f"
    },
    {
      "id": "5e75295775806767bfc51f92d9fc78a87ab02b7a8ab57db7032dfb0ac0b991c0",
      "text": "that the",
      "hash": "3dcd878494b700b9af17ffe4822d91bcb8f0b1d1b2c9f664872b951be025dff3"
    },
    {
      "id": "5678979be02f91d32b99c084ab48abec04c0ad47f0420c8d1de8a918e40cdc29",
      "text": "loads into the",
      "hash": "09330faeb3c42f6feabfb09cd64418c9f5c4d07504c6cfc75203fcdc8b4031c7"
    },
    {
      "id": "c6696e25c8095cedbd361760918f8852048ce4c2475eb8e6160f2fe2aa8dd127",
      "text": "context window",
      "hash": "6764434518d37f01df452fe2af0af3f314f8c27a72519001ea14189c5ee42476"
    },
    {
      "id": "00579b5126a0982901c25489d5d906cb1a6c00d39938f11925c9c682f645dd94",
      "text": "start — the project's standing brief to the",
      "hash": "c2bb44d25a0a4d2dc6e75335076e951bb2740847ea1403792dfe7b8cb53647ce"
    },
    {
      "id": "b57b5118ca604cd47b18bbf3cc488723d9750620f65677c62c0bc229c9fcce4d",
      "text": ". Cross-harness convention; some harnesses also have their own variant (Claude Code's is CLAUDE.md).",
      "hash": "b24baf4bfe082eb775f381d66ba22d1217fdca1a01a64cbc65efb2f65f2cb2d1"
    },
    {
      "id": "e7a314be18c4e00e34c1365649d21df9dbd5566b41ec5f6ea8ccc2867eeb3a54",
      "text": "Because it loads automatically, it's one way to avoid repeating yourself across sessions. The",
      "hash": "57794d4722dd87796b3da3dbd12eca37d9e1ab5f60d52669c97a7f15db3ac5c1"
    },
    {
      "id": "0a8e351cd95c09f427b6d7e2f1430be3442778b7736b0ae49bb024a0515f74ea",
      "text": "— a correction you give in one session is gone in the next, and you end up telling every fresh session that the project uses pnpm, that tests run with a particular flag, that a directory is generated and shouldn't be touched. When you've corrected the agent for the same thing twice, that correction is a candidate line for AGENTS.md.",
      "hash": "975e56a0b8f62331972d3e82b0c6408ff74bebf914f0b7b91ba5d26d6da78835"
    },
    {
      "id": "861135e9a12805d2bfc51f3b23cb65c52ba22b16571832f2914f33f5a16fdbd7",
      "text": "Suitable content is whatever the agent can't derive from the code: build and test commands, conventions the codebase doesn't make obvious, hard constraints (\"never edit the generated client\"). Short and declarative — it's a brief, not documentation.",
      "hash": "6b18f9607ed366e2684d56510d76ccb5aca8f97da992405000cccd045d8030c6"
    },
    {
      "id": "12ba110ce686312883a7478ff24dde7cf6e8bfdc5a41a8b61decb72322c3f688",
      "text": "The trade-off is that everything in it is always loaded. Instructions accumulate, most of them irrelevant to any given task, and a long AGENTS.md both costs tokens and dilutes itself — the more instructions in context, the less reliably the model follows any one of them.",
      "hash": "0092c695fa2a1adeab9032434da477675f1be0f93148bc968337900e65abaf20"
    },
    {
      "id": "cd4d8a947863ee673694c803db47d5ceba25ad5f66d762523837f7a01d4eb08b",
      "text": "Avoid:",
      "hash": "0c98d3dd1920fdb71269240ba1ce3a7323099760ecd0b295f071aca6b07e30df"
    },
    {
      "id": "57452aede18b9498ade109ff6bc7bccb869e1b25b617a2fa39079bd776bf88a3",
      "text": "using AGENTS.md for content that should be",
      "hash": "0dd627f081be440e43ffcbeaed803b5621011b3f797871935f2408177f5b9961"
    },
    {
      "id": "fa9dc8ca78bb90b33b261d943ae27d6e83b367afa5164a467bd358285516e5f0",
      "text": "progressively disclosed",
      "hash": "45a142f3d761dd2c770826d4657d02893c1d980d6132338651f7a5c6f59784ba"
    },
    {
      "id": "24b30998300b84cc2c09c2ec5b1ec4b1145b02529a2a935351f3678a305a37de",
      "text": "— anything in it pays a",
      "hash": "43b13b424791a31b37c225b3a4dfa1b8b7c968f70b46b15f500dea5fcc31486c"
    },
    {
      "id": "d3259255e23d9fdc1bc176da8f640453401cfce6f276bfb07ee74cb422698156",
      "text": "cost every",
      "hash": "dbadb2394bab08c83d049478a94f767566a8121b44cbf5393b3edcdca67900ff"
    },
    {
      "id": "69d0185b39e6897757867b330485e8124e09377e85da9924b6723523ed78d513",
      "text": ", in every session, whether or not that session needs it. A style guide can go behind a",
      "hash": "4c8394a207acc49d4655bf4e1e116281fdb21c0227058b338b536957f95b4472"
    },
    {
      "id": "2fd1b16bb3fc931b878bdd0709c9507e259d0e5f93a619401e6a41189bfd7ca6",
      "text": "or a",
      "hash": "38596115fa6292b5ec3e278f4289002f38a7e8760fba7e7c9e5d6e35c0b38820"
    },
    {
      "id": "b4d5cbd3149d4fb0c2a3b444eedb7115f01ba23173902f36dbd8af4efa277538",
      "text": "context pointer",
      "hash": "7fb80893d92cf9accaa94f3b2f011e80e1ed58eb0ec3e161e07b14e34c36ca1b"
    },
    {
      "id": "db052013725e3c55ed7dae04f8e83d5760ce46e149a027e20247789c444e8b37",
      "text": "instead; keep AGENTS.md for the lines that apply everywhere.",
      "hash": "238f4fb956d830fd100cca9418709dcbdfef7c1963bdaabdca8e10a35edb97c3"
    },
    {
      "id": "40a5243617f8a634760590b50d5b62b3876db2f2cebbaf606da5b72f0f3b1829",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "8e75d854de201e9c3e287f4f1a0833b1d302feea6bab2bdc4cebe822a49cb827",
      "text": "\"Why is every session starting with 4k tokens already burned?\"",
      "hash": "b802fa1b0fb774c16abcf6e431bf9ef136c1eaa8b98506aefa1493f0b27b4a76"
    },
    {
      "id": "8aaa8a8ad95bf6c2284feeacb115002c92705fd13c732fb70c255ef017e3e193",
      "text": "\"Check AGENTS.md — someone pasted the entire style guide in there instead of putting it behind a skill.\"",
      "hash": "72967d41be19d5790c2af8bb2114248a59f95de82d5266693c8826fbefad9263"
    },
    {
      "id": "dcebbdd1fddb07c70bfd5fd19e5f1586225589dc11c6a7bc388a28936ef751ef",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "e960c1d229093894122bc0ed89b32fb42f8c2bfc1b95c31a0f63a971c4422e5d",
      "text": "Memory system",
      "hash": "0262e82db5dfb849a70a2a6a94c1afd575205f2d24d5f001afa96f4d8dcb47d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "8fb1bb110360faf756f9882846fd5669e73144732596f37eba79ed680c9314f9",
      "text": "Next term",
      "hash": "5219c7ebdc0e098aa6db6f09e405c1b17ab75f1082862906a872e10a16818f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "4a0320f7d1408fff91226c023070ceb1a87ff174b3104ab0c9bea7a6052d2b06",
      "text": "Progressive disclosure",
      "hash": "cc1b70611c98675e8e42c8d6246c2f13f869540b48c6abd18713bd25ecc7611b"
    },
    {
      "id": "ea62bcafdf92c3734666433027ff02ca5307efc1d45199c560af89a01624d64f",
      "text": "Want more than vocabulary?",
      "hash": "5d5500a083006a1606e84a03c018904d01364631c6baea4c7a3f8f3f62bf94dc"
    },
    {
      "id": "d4d9b18fe1b32b3c25739c4588770159cb5b454d8623e39708208354864d6b42",
      "text": "Join AI Hero for practical skills, thinking on AI engineering, and resources that keep you ahead of the curve.",
      "hash": "a082f7147e30da6afe92268d5668a530edfff13e64934f8f63f22c098db86133"
    },
    {
      "id": "a83bc4c5a9896a1590cecd81cf0b571fb6beed9649cbab6c5c7bfde264179630",
      "text": "First Name",
      "hash": "96ce6e6193a047260f5c32aa416d88b6e8959111f43f98457af9cc009a0907ad"
    },
    {
